WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:32.670
App name taken: choose another

2
00:00:33.170 --> 00:01:14.370
ChatGPT says the change is done…

3
00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:28.540
…but the preview doesn't show it

4
00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:50.170
Say what you see; it checks the logs and finds the cause

5
00:01:50.670 --> 00:02:29.770
Ask it to fix it and check again

6
00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:41.440
Fixed on the preview

7
00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:59.070
Preview only, until you confirm publishing
